    "blurb": "A Bauhaus poster whose circles, bars and triangles slowly slide and rearrange themselves into new compositions on the beat",
    "prompt": "a Bauhaus poster whose circles, bars and triangles slowly slide and rearrange themselves into new compositions on the beat",
